    "chunk_text": "25AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'05'30PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.05.2019\n\nMy No: CI/1789\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131\n\nDecember 2018 is hereby published in terms of Section 06of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131, of theLegislative Enactments of Ceylon (Revised Edition 1956)\n\nA. WIMALAWEERA,Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDepartment of Labour,Labour Secretariat,Colombo 05,21st May, 2019.\n\nCollective Agreement No. 46 of 2018\n\nCOLLECTIVE AGREEMENT 2018 - 2020\n\nBy and Between\n\nHOUSING DEVELOPMENT FINANCECORPORATION BANK OF SRI LANKA\n\nSir Chiththampalam A Gardiner Mawatha, Colombo 02\n\nof the One PartAnd\n\nCEYLON BANK EMPLOYEES\u2019 UNIONNo.20, Temple Road, Colombo 10\n\nof the other part\n\nThis Collective Agreement is made on this 04th day ofDecember 2018 by and between the HDFC Bank of the onepart (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Bank\u201d) and the CeylonBank Employees Union of the other part (hereinafterreferred to as \u201cthe Union\u201d).\n\nThe HDFC Bank and the Ceylon Bank Employees Unionhereby agree as follows:\n\nTITLE : This Agreement will be known and referred to asCOLLECTIVE AGREEMENT OF \u201cHOUSINGDEVELOPMENT FINANCE CORPORATION BANK withTHE CEYLON BANK EMPLOYEES\u2019 UNION FOR THE\n\nPERIOD COMMENCING FROM FIRST JANUARY TWOTHOUSAND AND EIGHTEEN TO THIRTY FIRSTDECEMBER TWO THOUSAND AND TWENTY (01. 01.2018-31.12. 2020)\u201d\n\n1. EMPLOYER TO BE COVERED AND BOUND\n\nThis Agreement shall cover and bind the HDFC Bank,which is a party to this Agreement\n\n2. EMPLOYEES TO BE COVERED AND BOUND\n\nThis Agreement shall cover and bind members of theCeylon Bank Employees\u2019 Union in employment withthe Bank and who are employed in any of the categoriesof whom a salary scale has been prescribed in thisAgreement in the \u201cAnnexure 1\u201d attached hereto.\n\n3. DATE OF OPERATION AND DURATION"
