    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'05'31PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 31.05.20191A\n\nwxl 2125$66 - 2019 uehs ui 31 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'05'31No. 2125/66 - FRIDAY MAY 31, 2019\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nOrder No. 54\n\nCONSUMER AFFAIRS AUTHORITY ACT, No. 09 OF 2003\n\nOrder under Section 20(5)\n\nACTING under the powers vested in it by Section 20(5) of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 09 of 2003, theConsumer Affairs Authority orders that no producer, distributor or trader shall sell, expose or offer for sale or display forsale the following varieties of rice above the Maximum Retail Prices given hereunder :-\n\nVarietyMaximum Retail Price\n\nWhite Samba - steamed/boiled - LocalRs. 85/- per kg(Excluding Keeri Samba and Suduru Samba)\n\nWhite Nadu - boiled/steamed - LocalRs. 80/- per kg(Excluding Mottaikarupan and Attakari)\n\nRed Nadu - boiled/steamed - LocalRs. 74/- per kg(Excluding Mottaikarupan and Attakari)\n\nThis Order shall come into effect from 31st May, 2019.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - PG 4537\u2014 217 (05/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'05'31PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 31.05.20192A\n\nThe Consumer Affairs Authority do by this order rescind Order No. 49 published in Gazette ExtraordinayNo. 2051/8 dated 26th December, 2017.\n\nBy Order of the Consumer Affairs Authority,\n\nDR. LALITH N. SENAWEERA,Chairman.\n\nColombo,31st May, 2019.\n\n06 - 433\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
