    "chunk_text": "1A\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2125/67 - 2019 \u0db8\u0dd0\u0250 \u0db8\u0dc3 31 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.05.31\n\nNo. 2125/67 \u2013 FRIDAY, MAY, 31, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/6/2016/HW/159. My Ref. No.: DSO/HOM/LAC/101. I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose. Description of the land to be acquired: Lot Nos. (1-6)) Lots 06 allotments of land in total extent of about 0.0250 Hectare, Preliminary Plan No. CO 9779 and dated 31.12.2018 prepared by the Senior - Superintendent of Surveyor of Colombo District on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in the Villages of Munamale Yakahaluwa, Kithulawila in the Grama Niladhari Division of Munamale-Yakahaluwa, No. 603C, in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Homagama in Colombo District in the Western Province. 01. Lot No. 1 Name of land: Yakahaluwakele; Description: School Land; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: WP/Ho/Jayathilaka Maha Vidyalaya, Kiriwaththuduwa (To finalize the land acquisition), ; Extent: 0.0198 Hectare.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n1A- G 30213 - 32 (2019/05)"
