    "chunk_size_bytes": 2029,
    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2126$2 - 2019 cqks ui 03 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'06'03No. 2126/2 - MONDAY JUNE 03, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KARANDENIYAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of a return member of Karandeniya pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichBodiya Baduge Lalith Rathnakumara Gamini Perera the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) ofthe aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returned member of Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna who belongs to such partyand is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selectedas a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Thommaya Hakuru Nirosh Sanjeewa Ranasinghe to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Kanda Uda Chandralal, Returning Officer of the Karandeniya pradeshiya Sabha, acting interms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that ThommayaHakuru Nirosh Sanjeewa Ranasinghe was selected as the member of the Karandeniya pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nK. U. CHANDRALAL,Returning Officer,Karandeniya pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Galle,30th May, 2019.\n\n06 - 503\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 30215\u2014 37 (06/2019)"
