    "chunk_size_bytes": 1640,
    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 30215\u2014 37 (06/2019)\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KARANDENIYAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of a return member of Karandeniya pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichWeliwiti Godage Thamara Kumari the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaidordinance, to decide upon returned member of Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna who belongs to such party and is notdisqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a memberwithin a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Liyana Gamage Manel Priyani Jayasekara to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Kanda Uda Chandralal, Returning Officer of the Karandeniya pradeshiya Sabha, acting interms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that LiyanaGamage Manel Priyani Jayasekara was selected as the member of the Karandeniya pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nK. U. CHANDRALAL,Returning Officer,Karandeniya pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Galle,30th May, 2019.\n\n06 - 504\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
