    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Ahila Ilankai Thamil Congress, the recognized political party to whichAalvappillai Santhakumar the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, todecide upon returned member of Ahila Ilankai Thamil Congress who belongs to such party and is not disqualified underSection 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period ofthirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision to nominateSivakumaran Gajen to fill such vacancy ;\n\nR. C. AMALRAAJ,Returning Officer,Chavakachcheri Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Jaffna,31st May, 2019.\n\n06 - 505/4\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
