    "chunk_text": "Miss H. M. Anulawathi, No. 599, Gohagoda Road, Katugastota to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by\n\narbitration.\n\nRAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,\n\nMinister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,\n\n28th May, 2019.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2018/73.\n\n1956 REVISED EDITION\n\nof the one part\n\nSamastha Lanka Motor Sewaka Samithiya, No. 10/21A, Jayasundara Place, Elhena Road, Maharagama. (On behalf of Mr.\n\nM. Imthiyas)\n\nand\n\nof the other part\n\nSri Lanka Transport Board, No. 200, Kirula Road, Colombo - 05.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\nWhether Mr. M. Imthiyas who worked as the Foreman of the Meethotamulla Depot of the Sri Lanka Transport Board, has been caused\n\ninjustice by the disciplinary order/Punishment given after the disciplinary inquiry conducted with regard to an accident that had happened\n\non 12.10.2016 and if so, to what reliefs he is entitled.\n\nA. WIMALAWEERA,\n\nCommissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,\n\nColombo,\n\nThis 21st day of May, 2019.\n\n06 - 511\n\nI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'03PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20193A\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/05/2018/80.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS an industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner General of Labour whichaccompanies this order exists between,\n\nof the one part\n\nCeylon Bank Employees\u2019 Union - Regional Development Branch, \u2018\u2018Bank Union\u2019\u2019 \u2013 Colombo, No. 507/1, Kandy Road,Pattiya, Kelaniya. (On behalf of Mr. K. D. Shantha Wipulasena)\n\nandof the other part\n\nRegional Development Bank, Head Office, No. 933, Kandy Road, Wedamulla, Kelaniya."
