    "chunk_text": "IT is hereby notified that HIS EXCELLENCY THE PRESIDENT has been pleased, under Article 44(1) of the Constitution of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, to appoint Hon. Wasantha Naresh Parakrama Senanayaka, MP, as StateMinister of Foreign Affairs, with effect from May 29, 2019.\n\nBy Order of His Excellency,\n\n06 - 524/2\n\nNOTIFICATION\n\nP. S. No. : PS/CSA/00/1/13/12\n\nIT is hereby notified that the under mentioned Hon. Ministers have resigned their officers under Article 46(3)(b) of theConstitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, with effect from May 29, 2019.\n\nNameOffice\n\n1.Hon. Pelisge Harison, MP-Minister of Agriculture,Rural Economic Affairs, LivestockDevelopment, Irrigation and Fisheries andAquatic Resources Development\n\n2.Hon. Rathnayaka Mudiyanselage-Minister of PublicRanjith Madduma Bandara, MPAdministration and DisasterManagement\n\nBy Order of His Excellency,\n\nUDAYA R. SENEVIRATNE,Secretary to the President.Presidential Secretariat,Colombo 01,May 31, 2019.\n\n06 - 524/3\n\nGovernment Notifications"
