    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2126$17 - 2019 cqks ui 04 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'06'04No. 2126/17 - TUESDAY JUNE 04, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KORALAIPATTU WESTPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Koralaipattu West Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United National Party, the recognized political party to which SehulebbaiFayisa the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide uponreturned member if United National Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Muhaideen Pawa Jemeela to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Rajendra Saseelan, Returning Officer of the Koralaipattu West Pradeshiya Sabha, actingin terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that MuhaideenPawa Jemeela was selected as the member of the Koralaipattu West Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nR. SASEELAN,Returning Officer,Koralaipattu West Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Batticaloa,03rd June, 2019.\n\n06 - 526\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
