    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2126$18 - 2019 cqks ui 04 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'06'04No. 2126/18 - TUESDAY JUNE 04, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KALMUNAI MUNICIPALCOUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Kalmunai Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the All Ceylon Makkal Congress, the recognized political party to whichYakkoob Kaleelur Rahman the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance,to decide upon returned member if All Ceylon Makkal Congress who belongs to such party and is not disqualified underSection 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a periodof thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Aliyar Neyna Muhammadu to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Don Thilina Ishan Wickramarathna, Returning Officer of the Kalmunai Municipal Council,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatAliyar Neyna Muhammadu was selected as the member of the Kalmunai Municipal Council.\n\nTHILINA WICKRAMARATHNA,Returning Officer,Kalmunai Municipal Council.District Election Office,Ampara,03rd June, 2019.\n\n06 - 527\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
