bins and not causing nuisance until they are disposed properly. (xxiii) The material required for the industry should be kept stored in the premises without any dangerous or harmful manner. (xxiv) Provided that all the waste material produced at the licenced premises are recycled, action shall be taken to categorize the waste material under the following categories and maintain them in separate bins;\n\n(a) bio degradable waste ;\n\n(b) glass ;\n\n(c) paper;\n\n(d) polythene or plastic ;"
