    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'04PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 04.06.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.\n\nThe Allotments of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. Ku/KRN/2019/18 of 31.01.2019 prepared by the Surveyor-Generalsituated in the Villages of Boyagane, Olupeliyawa and Ganegedara inthe Grama Niladhari Divisions of 829-Boyagane, 830-Madithiyawela in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kurunegalaof Kurunegala District in North Western Province and described inbelow names and extents as follows:\n\n1. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Not Known - Extent: 0.0854 HectareNorth: Reservation along Road; East: Road (R.D.A.); South: LotNo.46; West: Lot Nos. 43, 42,39, 38, 35, 34, 18, 14, 13, 7 and LotNo.2.\n\n2. Lot No. 2 \u2013 Not Known - Extent: 0.0096 HectareNorth: Reservation along Stream and Stream; East: Reservationalong Road and Lot No.1; South: Lot Nos.1 and 7; West: Lot No.3.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2126$28 \u2013 2019 cqks 04 jeks w`.yrejdod \u2013 2019'06'04No. 2126/28 \u2013 TUESDAY, JUNE 04, 2019\n\n3. Lot No. 3 \u2013 Not Known - Extent: 0.0069 HectareNorth: Millagahamula Hena, Ambul Bakmigahamula Hena claimedby A.R.M. Feros and Reservation along Stream; East: Lot No.2;South: Lot No.7; West: Lot Nos. 6,5 and 4."
