    "chunk_size_bytes": 2126,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2126/34 - 2019 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 04 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.06.04\n\nNo. 2126/34 \u2013 TUESDAY, JUNE, 04, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460) As amended\n\nby Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of\n\n1964 )\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act, as amended by land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands/servitude which is required for a public purpose..\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired:\n\nSituated in the village Palawela in the Grama Niladhari Division of Batakada, in Nawadun Korale of the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Elapatha, in Ratnapura District, Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\nPlan No. F. V. P. 60, Supplement No. 15\n\nLot No. 123 Name of the land: Diyakadagawa, Aluthwaththa; Claimed by: The Government acquired under Provision 38 (a) of the land Acquisition Act; The Original Claimer is Asanka Weerasuriya of Uda Niriella, Palawela; Extent: 0.0075 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally, or by agent duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Elapatha at 10.00 a. m. on the 17th day of July 2019.\n\nFurther, they should notify me in writting and in duplicate before the 03rd of July 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. Documents should be submitted to me on the same date to prove the interests.\n\ngfg S. A. DILRUK, Divisional Secretary, Elapatha. On the 29th day of May 2019, At the Divisional Secretariat, Elapatha.\n\n06-563\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices"
