    "chunk_text": "gfg S. A. DILRUK, Divisional Secretary, Elapatha. On the 29th day of May 2019, At the Divisional Secretariat, Elapatha.\n\n06-563\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.06.04 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 04.06.2019\n\nThe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy No.: 6/3/7/15/1. Land Ministry\u2019s Ref. No.: LD/05/2007/MV/300.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for the Moragahakanda/Kaluganga Development Project purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired: Public purpose means the land Acquisition for the Moragahakanda & Kaluganga Development Project.\n\nThe lands described below, shown in Surveyor General\u2019s final Village Plan No. 533 of supplement 4 in Sheet No. 3, approved on 07.05.2019, situated at Moragolla Grama Niladhari Division, Gangala Pallesiya Pattuwa in Naula Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Matale District, Central Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 271\n\nName of Land: Marakkayakotuwa Kumbura, Marakkayakotuwa; Description: Paddy Field; Claimant: Mr. Agarapola Gedera Kiribanda of Moragolla; Possessed by Mr. A. G. Wasantha Saman Kumara of Moragolla; Extent: 0.1616 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 272\n\nName of Land: Marakkayakotuwa Kumbura, Marakkayakotuwa; Description: Paddy Field; Claimant: Mr. Heneyale Gedara Pataya Henaya of Moragolla; Possessed by Mr. A. G. Indrajith Surendra Somapala of Moragolla; Extent: 0.2079 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 273\n\nName of Land: Marakkayakotuwa Kumbura, Marakkayakotuwa; Description: Paddy Field; Claimant:\n\nThe state; Cultivated under the permit by Mr. Aluth Gedara Emalin of Moragolla; Extent: 0.2665 Hectare.\n\n04. Lot No. 274"
