    "chunk_text": "Name of Land: Marakkayakotuwa Kumbura, Marakkayakotuwa; Description: Paddy Field; Claimant:\n\nThe state; Cultivated under the permit by Mr. Aluth Gedara Emalin of Moragolla; Extent: 0.2665 Hectare.\n\n04. Lot No. 274\n\n05. Lot No. 275\n\nName of Land: Mahawela Kumbura; Description: Paddy Field; Claimant: Mr. Agarapola Gedara Heenbanda of Moragolla; Possessed by Mr. A G. Gamini Wijewardana of Moragolla; Extent: 0.2193 Hectare.\n\n06. Lot No. 276\n\nName of Land: Mahawela Kumbura; Description: Paddy Field; Claimant: Mr. Aluth Gedara Horathala of Moragolla; Possessed by Mr. A. G. Jamis of Moragolla; Extent: 0.1832 Hectare.\n\n07. Lot No. 277\n\nName of Land: Mahawela Kumbura; Description: Paddy Field; Claimant: Mr. H. M. Dharmasena of Moragolla; Extent: 0.1368 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents before me at 9.00 a. m. On the 26th day of June 2019 at the Naula Divisional Secretariat.\n\nAnd further you are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 19 day of June 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\ngfg ATHMA DILUKSHI JAYARATHNA, Divisional Secretary, Naula. At the Naula Divisional Secretariat, 29th May 2019. 06-564\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
