    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2126$38 - 2019 cqks ui 06 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'06'06No. 2126/38 - THURSDAY JUNE 06, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE THUMPANE PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1)(a) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of member of Thumpane Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of not attending forCouncil meetings for a period of three months without permission ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichKandanhena Yamanage Manjula Dinesh Yamanage the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1)(a) ofthe aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon member of that Number 05 Bananga if Thumpane Pradeshiya Sabha who belongsto such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall bedeclared elected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Weerakoon Mudiyanselage Dayarathna Banda to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Talangama Appuhamilage Chaminda Namal Talangama, Returning Officer of the ThumpanePradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1)(a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) dohereby declare that Weerakoon Mudiyanselage Dayarathna Banda was elected as the member of the No. 5 Bananga ofThumpane Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nT. A. C. N. TALANGAMA,Returning Officer,Thumpane Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kandy,4th June, 2019.\n\n06 - 589\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT"
