    "chunk_text": "Claimant: U. Saul Hameed in Danduyaya, Galewela; Extent: 0.187 Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 1074 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Water Trace and Paddy Field; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: U. Saul Hameed in Danduyaya, Galewela; Extent: 0.026 Hectare.\n\ngfg M. U. NISHANTHA, Divisional Secretary, Galewela.\n\nDivisional Secretary\u2019s Office, 04th June, 2019 06-593\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30244 - 17 (2019/06)\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.06.06 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.06.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act, as amended by The land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land or Servitude to be acquired:\n\nDescription of the said area - Allotments of land from No. 520 to 540 (Described in the Schedule) in Plan F. V. P. No. 409, Situated in Walaswewa Village in Walaswewa Grama Niladhari Division No. E 433 in Kandapalla Korale in Galewela Divisional Secretariat Division in Matale District in Central Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 520 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Chena; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anula Kumarihamy in Walaswewa; Amount: 0.002 Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 522 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Chena; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anula Kumarihamy in Walaswewa; Amount: 0.008 Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 523 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Chena; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anula Kumarihamy in Walaswewa; Amount: 0.002 Hectare."
