    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'12PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.06.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2127$16 \u2013 2019 cqks 12 jeks nodod \u2013 2019'06'12No. 2127/16 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 12, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 30278 \u2013 31 (2019/06)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are needed fora public purpose and will be acquired under provisions of that Act.\n\nThe Allotments of land Advance Tracing No. KE/RMB/2017/280prepared by the Surveyor General of Kegalle, situated in the Villagecalled Kotawella in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 3GKotawella, Minor Division in the Kinigoda Korale, DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division of Rambukkana in Kegalle District of theSabaragamuwa Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Katakalagahamulawaththa \u2013 Extent: 0.0018HectareNorth: Katakalagahamulawaththa; East: Cement Drain andLot B; South: Lots B, J and Katakalagahamulawaththa; West:Katakalagahamulawaththa.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Extent: 0.0009 HectareNorth: Lot A, Katakalagahamulawaththa and Cement Drain;East: Road (R.D.A.) and Lot C; South: Lot C; West: Lot J,Katakalagahamulawaththa and Lot A.\n\n03. Lot \u2018C\u2019 \u2013 Extent: 0.0913 HectareNorth: Lots J, A, Katakalagahamulawaththa and Road (R.D.A.);East: Cement Drain, Lots D, M, T and Lot T in Advanced TracingNo. KE/RMB/2016/115; South: Lots C and B in Advanced TracingNo. KE/RMB/2016/115; West: Lots R, N, Foot Path, Ela, Lots K, Jand A."
