    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2127$17 - 2019 cqks ui 12 jeks nodod - 2019'06'12No. 2127/17 - WEDNESDAY JUNE 12, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE BERUWALA URBANCOUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of a return member of Beruwala Urban Council has fallen vacant by reason of not attending forcouncil meetings period of three months without permission ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United National Party, the recognized political party to which MohamedNalim Fathima Shiyama the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, todecide upon returned member of United National Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty(30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Mohamed Hasan Fathima Rinusa to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Wannakuwatta Waduge Kalindra Jayaweera Fernando, Returning Officer of the BeruwalaUrban Council, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do herebydeclare that Mohamed Hasan Fathima Rinusa was selected as the member of the Beruwala Urban Council.\n\nKALINDRA JAYAWEERA FERNANDO,Returning Officer,Beruwala Urban Council.District Election Office,Kalutara,11th June, 2019.\n\n06 - 754\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
