    "chunk_text": "wxl 2127$19 - 2019 cqks ui 12 jeks nodod - 2019'06'12No. 2127/19 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 12, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk1A\n\n1A- G 30281 - 20 (06/2019)\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nRef. No.: MLB/LND/LNDAQ/L1/44-3.\n\nLand Ministry's Ref. No.: 4-3/9/2017/WS/11.\n\nIT is hereby give notice under Sub section (1) of Section 7 ofLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the land acquisitionamendment act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Governmentintended to acquire the following land or servitude which isrequired for public purpose:\n\nBelow mentioned land depicted as lot No. 01 in plan no.PP/MR/2774 situated in the Village of Katuwangoda, inMalimbada Divisional Secretariat Division, in MataraDistrict in Southern province was acquired for theconstruction of Uninduwela water purifier, storage that,Administration building, Factory and office quarters underMatara 4th step of water supply scheme.\n\nSub schedule.\n\n01. Lot No. 1Name of the Land: Katuwalage watta andPunchilamahamilage Koratuwa; Description of the land:\n\nJungle with scrub; Initial claimant of the land: N. B.Palihawadana and Ramasiri Palihawadana; Extent: 1.4164Hectares.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha land / servitude is to be acquired are hereby to appear,personally, or by agent duly authorized in writing, beforeme at Divisional Secretariat Malimbada on the 27th day ofJune 2019 at 10.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notifyto me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 20th day ofJune the nature of their interests in the land, the particularsof their claims for compensation for the acquisition of thesaid land/servitude, the amount of compensation and thedetails of the computation of such amount."
