    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'05'21PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 21.05.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2127$20 \u2013 2019 cqks 12 jeks nodod \u2013 2019'06'12No. 2127/20 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 12, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 30282 \u2013 16 (06/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAn allotment of land depicted in Advance TracingNo. Co/KDW/2017/38 dated 20.11.2017, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Thalangama North (within theMunicipal Council limits of Kaduwela) in 477 - A, ThalangamaNorth, B Grama Niladhari Division within the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Kaduwela in Colombo District, Western Province andbounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Dombagahawatta \u2013 Extent : 0.3717 HectareNorth: Dombagahawatta claimed by Divisional SecretariatKaduwela, Dombagahawatta claimed by Road Passenger Transport\n\nAuthority and Dombagahawatta claimed by S and P PropertyDevelopers; East: Dombagahawatta claimed by Road PassengerTransport Authority and Dombagahawatta claimed by S and PProperty Developers; South: Udawatta Road; West: Udawatta Roadand Dombagahawatta claimed by Divisional Secretariat Kaduwela.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/11/2016/UDA/341.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u2018\u2018Mihikatha Medura\u2019\u2019,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.09th April, 2019.\n\n06 - 789"
