    "chunk_size_bytes": 2033,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2127/21 - 2019 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 12 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.06.12 No. 2127/21 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 12, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) AS AMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION (AMENDEMENT) ACT No. 28 OF 1964 Notice under Section 07 My Reference No.: DIK/LAN/02/60. I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 07, of the Land Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964 (Amendement) that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose. Description of the land to be acquired:- Following lands mentioned in the preliminary plan No. 2797 of Surveyor General Matara and situated in village of Belideniya, Grama Niladhari Division of Belideniya in Dickwella Divisional Secretariat of Matara District. 1. Lot No. 01 Name of the land: Mataraaththannehena Alias Mataraattannewatta; Description: Home Garden, there is a mix cultivation; Claimed by: Gamini Wijendra, Belideniya, Kottagoda; Extent: 0.3103 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby\n\nrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly\n\nauthorized in writing, before me at the Dickwella\n\nDivisional Secretary\u2019s Office on the 10th day of July\n\n2019 at 10.30 a.m. are hereby requested to Notify to me\n\nin writing (in duplicate) on or before the 03rd of July,\n\n2019 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars\n\nof their claims for compensation, for the Acquisition of\n\nthe said lands the amount of compensation and the details\n\nof the computation of such amount. All deeds and\n\ndocuments in support of the claims should be produced\n\nbefore me at the inquiry.\n\nB. S. RANJITHA, Divisional Secretary, Dickwella\n\nDivisional Secretariat Dickwella, 03rd June, 2019. 06-790\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices"
