    "chunk_text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'13PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 13.06.20191A\n\nwxl 2127$27 \u2013 2019 cqks 13 jeks n%yiam;skaod \u2013 2019'06'13No. 2127/27 \u2013 THURSDAY, JUNE 13, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2018/123.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS an industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner of Labour which accompanies thisorder exists between,\n\nof the one part\n\nMr. S. A. Daya Keerthi Bandara, No. 250, Koswatta, Halmillawewa.\n\nandof the other part\n\nMerchant Bank of Sri Lanka and Finance PLC, 17th Floor, Bank of Ceylon Building, No. 28, St. Michael\u2019s Road, Colombo - 03\n\nNOW THEREFORE I, Ravindra Samaraweera, Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations do by virtue of the powers vested in me bySection 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended by\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A \u2013 G30290 \u2013 21 (2019/06)\n\n2AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'13PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 13.06.2019\n\nAct, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes (Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint\n\nMr. Obadage Lelarathne No. 242, Sri Sobitha Mawatha, Nagoda, Kalutara to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for\n\nsettlement by arbitration.\n\nRAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,\n\nMinister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,\n\n06th June, 2019."
