    "chunk_text": "1AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'14PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 14.06.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2127$29 - 2019 cqks ui 14 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'06'14No. 2127/29 - FRIDAY JUNE 14, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4536 \u2014 117 (06/2019)\n\nWESTERN PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nOrder pertaining to the delegation of powers of the Western Provincial Public Service under the Section32(2a) of the Provincial Councils Act, No. 42 of 1987 as amended by the Provincial Councils (Amendment)Act, No. 28 of 1990\n\nIT is hereby announced that the without prejudice to the actions taken under the Schedule number 01 of order dated26.06.2018 published on the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2082/7 dated 31st July 2018 regarding the course of implementingthe powers delegated with relevance to the appointment, transfers, promotion, dismissal and disciplinary control of theofficers of the Western Provincial Public Service subject to the provisions in clause 32(2a) of the Provincial Councils Act,No. 42 of 1987 as (Amended) Act, No. 28 of 1990, the said Order is amended by removing Schedule Number 01 andsubstituting it by the Schedule mentioned below as Number 01 to be effective from 16.05.2019.\n\nSUNIL ABEWARDHANA, Chairman,Provincial Public Service Commission,Western Province.\n\nWestern Provincial Public Service Commission,No. 109, Main Street,Battaramulla,On this 16th day of May 2019.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'14PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE D