    "chunk_text": "Western Provincial Public Service Commission,No. 109, Main Street,Battaramulla,On this 16th day of May 2019.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'14PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 14.06.20192A\n\n(a). Disciplinary control (subject to the ordersof Public Service Commission)*\n\n(a). Transfers among Ministries, Departmentsand Institutions(b). Dismissal from service and disciplinarycontrol\n\n(a). Transfers and disciplinary control amongthe Chief Secretariat and institutionsaffiliated to the Chief Secretariat.(b). Transfers among Ministries, Departmentsand Institutions.\n\n(a). Appointment to the posts, promotion andtransfers, dismissal from service anddisciplinary control of the officersbelonging to the Chief Secretariat in theWestern Province and to the institutionsaffiliated to the Chief Secretariat.(b). Transfers among Ministries, Departmentsand Institutions except local GovernmentInstitutions.(c). Taking actions regarding inter-provincialattachments/release of minor employees.\n\n1. Chief Secretary(I) Officers belong to All Island Services\n\ni. Sri Lanka Administrative Serviceii. Sri Lanka Engineering Serviceiii. Sri Lanka Scientific Serviceiv. Sri Lanka Architecture Servicev. Sri Lanka Accountant Servicevi. Sri Lanka Procurement Servicevii. Sri Lanka Education Administrative Serviceviii. Sri Lanka Animal Products and Health Serviceix. Sri Lanka Medical Servicex. Sri Lanka Indigenous Medical Servicexi. Sri Lanka Survey Servicexii. Sri Lanka Agriculture Service\n\n(II) Officers belong to All Island Services (ExceptEducational Administrative Service)\n\n(III) Where the Western Provincial Public ServiceCommission is the appointing authority: -\n\n(i) Officers belong to SL salary group(except the posts of SL salary grouplimited to local government authorities)"
