    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2018'04'09Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.04.20181A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2127$30 - 2019 cqks ui 14 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'06'14No. 2127/30 - FRIDAY, JUNE 14, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KALMUNAI MUNICIPAL COUNCILUNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Kalmunai Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason of resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the National Front of Good Governance, the recognized political party to whichAbdul Gafoor Mohammathu Natheer the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaidordinance, to decide upon returned member if National Front of Good Governance who belongs to such party and is notdisqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a memberwithin a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision to nominateThajutheen Mohammathu Mufaris to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Don Thilina Ishan Wickramarathna, Returning Officer of Kalmunai Municipal Council,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that ThajutheenMohammathu Mufaris was selected as the member of the Kalmunai Municipal Council.\n\nTHILINA WICKRAMARATHNA,Returning Officer,Kalmunai Municipal Council.District Election Office,Ampara,13th June, 2019.\n\n06 - 900\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
