    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2127$31 - 2019 cqks ui 14 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'06'14No. 2127/31 - FRIDAY JUNE 14, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE ATTANAGALLAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Attanagalla Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resigning ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the National Front of Good Governance, the recognized political party towhich Mohamed Raheem Mohamed Rassem the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of theaforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returned member of National Front for Good Governance who belongs to suchparty and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declaredselected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision to nominateMuhammadu Mansoor Shiras Mohamed to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Karunasingha Jayarathnage Sampath Madhawa, Returning Officer of the AttanagallaPradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do herebydeclare that Muhammadu Mansoor Shiras Mohamed was selected as the member of the Attanagalla Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nK. J. S. MADHAWA,Returning Officer,Attanagalla Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Gampaha,13th June, 2019.\n\n06 - 901\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
