    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'04'26PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 26.04.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2128$21 \u2013 2019 cqks 19 jeks nodod \u2013 2019'06'19No. 2128/21 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 19, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration Under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary\n\nReforms hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the\n\nLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a\n\npublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nThe allotment of land called as Walgamage Kumbura situated in\n\nthe village of Kongala (F.V.P. 187) in the Kandabada Paththu East\n\nminor Division within the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of\n\nHakmana, in Matara District, Southern Province depicted in the\n\nAdvance Tracing No. MR/HKM/2017/10 and dated 11.08.2017\n\nprepared by the Surveyar-General and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018\u2018A\u2019\u2019 \u2013 Walgamage Kumbura \u2013 Extent: 0.0071 Hectare\n\nNorth: Road (R.D.A.); East: Road (R.D.A.); South: Road (R.D.A.)\n\nand Walgamage Kumbura land claimed by S. M. Wakishta; West:\n\nWalgamage Kumbura land claimed by S. M. Wakishta and Road\n\n(R.D.A.).\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,\n\nMinister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No : 4-3/9/2016/WS/85.\n\nDivisional Secretaries Ref. No : HAK-LAN-1-15.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\n\n\"Mihikatha Medura\",\n\nRajamalwaththa Road,\n\nBattaramulla.\n\n27th March, 2019.\n\n07 \u2013 62\n\n1A \u2013 G30314 \u2013 16 (06/2019)PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA"
