    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS Title Registration REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998 Declaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 849, 850, 851, 852, 853, 854, 855, 856, 857, 858, 859, 860, 861, 862, 863, 864, 865, 866, 867, 868, 869, 870, 871 and 872 of Block 01, contained in the Cadas-tral Map No. 110101, situated in the Village of Adagala, Aluthwewa, Ihalagama, Eppawala, Galmaduwa, Gam 07, Gammana 8, Katti-kulama, Medagama, Meegahawewa, Meegassaegama, Nallamudawa Road, Pottegama, Tammennawa, Thammennagama within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 379 - Keledivulwewa, 345 - Dunupothagama, 373 - Eppawala, 375 - Kiri Amunukole, 378 - Gal-maduwa, 380 - Kelesiyambaleawa, 381 - Medagama, 382 - Ihalagama, 393 - Endagala in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Tha-lawa, in the District of Anuradhapura, in the Province of North Central, referred to in Notice No. 11/0076 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 1588/12 of 10th February, 2009 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. K.A.K. RANJITH DHARMAPALA, Commissioner of Title Settlement. (Actg.) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 30th May, 2019\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0002 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2129/08 - 2019 \u0011\u0012 24 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0012 \u0dc3\u0017\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.0